      "id": "M4135-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "虚构操作：一个统计双潜在状态模型，u直接用于当前质量量预测，v只通过共同观测方程帮助估计u；转移/观测均为线性高斯形式，没有潜坐标到实测物理量的一一映射。仅在历史训练序列上用前向滤波、后向平滑及EM拟合参数；预测时参数固定，用截至发出时刻允许获得的测量递推状态，再由u输出当前质量估计。请写不超过85词、无最低字数要求的英文总览，以及不超过35词的贡献候选，必要审稿说明另放中文。保留两个潜状态的不同作用，不将它们改成物理健康状态/工况模式，不把训练平滑搬进零延迟预测，也不把状态递推写成参数学习。未给性能或相对已有工作的独特性证据，勿虚构。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Connect the auxiliary latent role through shared observations to quality estimation and keep EM fitting distinct from fixed-parameter state inference.",
        "Draft positive connected prose, with novelty/physical-identity limits in author notes rather than repetitive defensive manuscript sentences."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Declare statistical coordinates to be measured physical health states or operating modes.",
        "Infer online parameter learning, future measurement use or superior performance merely from filtering/smoothing names."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserved the direct/auxiliary latent roles, historical training smoothing/EM and fixed-parameter current-quality estimation, with connected positive prose and unproven novelty kept in author notes.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4135-revised.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4135-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_final_source_with_clarified_actual_input_timelines"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4135-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "两个独立正向控制：第一，机理模型明确定义状态为反应物浓度和温度，Kalman估计这些物理状态，转移/观测参数固定；第二，另一模型在每次预测输出后，用允许获得的过去数据执行在线EM，实际更新转移矩阵，再用于下一次预测。请分别给一句准确英文描述，并说明为何不能一律把所有state写成不可解释潜变量、也不能把第二项真正参数学习删掉。状态协方差是否自动是故障概率？不增加结果、阈值或数据访问权限。",
      "required_behaviors": [
