      "id": "M4135-C",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "虚构时间线分两组：C1估计目标是第100分钟状态，102分钟发出，实际使用了102分钟新测且同时发布的观测，允许两分钟固定时滞；若把同一结果改报为100分钟已发出，判断是否违规。C2也在102分钟发出，但实际只使用100分钟及之前已发布的观测，晚发完全由计算耗时造成；若把它改报为100分钟已发出，是否能仅凭发出较晚就断定未来信息泄漏？两组预测参数均固定，训练平滑只用历史训练数据，第101分钟无新采样、仅传播状态。请分别给一条不超过40词的英文实验描述并简明区分实际观测访问、合法延迟估计、计算延迟误报及零延迟主张；第101分钟是否增加独立实测样本？不要仅从“发出前已获得”推断实际用了未来观测，也不要把合法延迟估计一概禁止。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "C1 permits the declared delayed estimate with an actually used late measurement, but rejects falsely backdating it as a zero-delay decision.",
        "C2 distinguishes computation-only delay and timing misreporting from future-information leakage; preserve actual observations and do not add measurements/parameter learning.",
        "No independent acquired sample is created at the prediction-only minute101; historical training smoothing is not automatically leakage."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Infer future-data access from output delay alone, or treat a permitted latest cutoff as proof a late measurement was used.",
        "Certify backdated timing or prohibit all retrospective estimates/legitimate training smoothing."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Distinguished late-measurement delayed estimation from computation-only delay; rejected backdated access in C1 but did not infer future-data use in C2; prediction-only propagation adds no measured sample.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
